{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3526","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3526/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3526/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3526/events","html_url":"https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3526","id":39370079,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzOTM3MDA3OQ==","number":3526,"title":"Bug in sklearn.manifold tsne","user":{"login":"gchers","id":2278118,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzgxMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2278118?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gchers","html_url":"https://github.com/gchers","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gchers/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gchers/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gchers/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gchers/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gchers/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gchers/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gchers/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gchers/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gchers/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12995755,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjk5NTc1NQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"e10c02","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2014-08-03T13:20:40Z","updated_at":"2014-10-21T16:39:35Z","closed_at":"2014-10-21T16:39:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"It looks to me there's an issue when using some distance different from 'euclidean' in tsne implementation.\nExample:\n\n``` python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.manifold import TSNE\nx=np.random.randn(10,10)\nt=TSNE(metric='chebyshev')\nz=t.fit_transform(x)\nProduces:\nTypeError: pdist() got an unexpected keyword argument 'squared'\n```\n\nIn fact at lines 438-439 of sklearn/manifold/t_sne.py function _fit() I read:\ndistances = pairwise_distances(X, metric=self.metric, squared=True)\nwhich means that it always provides 'squared' argument to pairwise_distances(). Now, not all the distances support this (see sklearn/metric/pairwise.py), which leads to an error.\n\nI report this as an issue because in t_sne.py from line 338 it says:\n\n> If metric is a string, it must be one of the options\n> allowed by scipy.spatial.distance.pdist for its metric parameter, or\n> a metric listed in pairwise.PAIRWISE_DISTANCE_FUNCTIONS.\n\nI'd suggest to substitute line 438 with something like:\n\n``` python\nif self.metric == 'euclidean':\n    distances = pairwise_distances(X, metric=self.metric, squared=True)\nelse:\n    distances = pairwise_distances(X, metric=self.metric)\n```\n\nbut I'm quite sure it's not as simple as that: I don't, for example, understand why the author wanted `squared=True`.\n\nCheers\n","closed_by":{"login":"larsmans","id":335383,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNTM4Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/335383?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans","html_url":"https://github.com/larsmans","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3526/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3526/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}